{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/island-park-casa-bella-creek-harbour","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":684,"crm_id":"324","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"ready","title":"Island Park","slug":"island-park-casa-bella-creek-harbour","display_address":"Dubai Creek Harbour","building_type":["apartment"],"completion_year":"2025","developer":"Emaar Properties","price":1600671,"display_price":"1.6M","lattitude":25.2078432,"longitude":55.3418057,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Island Park 2 is a luxury second phase complex by developer Emaar Properties. The 11-storey building is located in the Creek Harbour neighborhood and features elegantly designed <strong>1, 2 and 3 bedroom</strong> apartments. Surrounded by beautiful lush landscapes, with easy access to the vibrant boulevard and top-notch amenities, this project offers everything you need for a comfortable and relaxed lifestyle.</p><p>Each of the apartments at Island Park 2 combines modern elements of first-class quality to form a luxurious living space. Perfectly calibrated proportions, rich finishes, thoughtful functionality will make living in the complex cozy and comfortable. From the windows of the apartments there is a beautiful view of Dubai Creek Tower and Burj Khalifa.</p><p>Residents of Island Park 2 always take advantage of the equipped fitness room, outdoor pool, barbecue area, children's playground. Security in the complex is provided by 24-hour security and video security systems.</p><p>The main feature of the neighborhood is the plenty of green recreation areas, gardens and parks. The embankment, marina, yacht club, many restaurants and cafes, branded stores are also within walking distance.</p><p>Good transport accessibility allows for quick access to key areas of Dubai. Dubai Mall is just 15 minutes away, Palm Jumeirah Island can be reached in 25 minutes, Dubai International Airport and Al Maktoum Airport in 20 and 45 minutes respectively.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/324/images/2024/04/08/FFG5yMyhfzf2rjaIEGNwze3b8RKrrMh6KVtqwFlN.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/04/08/FFG5yMyhfzf2rjaIEGNwze3b8RKrrMh6KVtqwFlN.png","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/324/images/2024/04/08/LTpBcUpfqHfC7hawpw852KP7kDpgOUwODFp0t8mN.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/04/08/LTpBcUpfqHfC7hawpw852KP7kDpgOUwODFp0t8mN.png","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/324/images/2024/04/08/HayTDb0lRArkK3YlzLhP5snJhyR9W7b6ptFQtA8D.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/04/08/HayTDb0lRArkK3YlzLhP5snJhyR9W7b6ptFQtA8D.png","__ggfxIndex":2},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/324/images/2024/04/09/eQgN4q8MEf9ybgZMXGQNhQ1GOiLgQbuGjK1xkIsT.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/04/09/eQgN4q8MEf9ybgZMXGQNhQ1GOiLgQbuGjK1xkIsT.png","__ggfxIndex":3},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/324/images/2024/04/08/lIbJcNxnaSNob9fp2U1sg0GVjn94taQ6kcn2IuPc.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/04/08/lIbJcNxnaSNob9fp2U1sg0GVjn94taQ6kcn2IuPc.png","__ggfxIndex":4},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/324/images/2024/04/09/kfjrWfkjF4FXj7MrvNUZY6TnGC5zZ3llUhXSQYBL.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/04/09/kfjrWfkjF4FXj7MrvNUZY6TnGC5zZ3llUhXSQYBL.png","__ggfxIndex":5},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/324/images/2024/04/08/cKpWZuT28ovZvdFjP65dpjD4Mt7tgTu8dtIP8oBW.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/04/08/cKpWZuT28ovZvdFjP65dpjD4Mt7tgTu8dtIP8oBW.png","__ggfxIndex":6}],"characteristics_module":null,"l